            challengeInterview: "Personality becomes just as important as modeling when the contestants are asked to speak for themselves in front of the room.",
            challengeMovement: "The week's challenge demands quick reactions, physical control, and the confidence to keep moving without losing focus.",
            challengeGeneral: "The models face a challenge that tests how quickly they can adapt when the brief moves outside a traditional photoshoot."
